@startuml mo_revisor
title mo_revisor: Revisor of Statutes (RSMo)
start
:GET revisor.mo.gov/main/Home.aspx
(table of contents: titles and chapters; weekly);
:owned chapters
(one unit per chapter, by hash);
note right
  Requests from all shards take turns on
  one lock, 2 s apart: the site blocks an IP that reads faster
  than ~1 page/s. A warning page backs off
  1 / 5 / 15 min and retries.
end note
fork
  :shard that owns "rx.aspx":
  GET rx.aspx (~10 MB, weekly);
  :one row per repealed or transferred
  section: note and date as printed;
  :mo_revisor_repeals;
fork again
  :GET OneChapter.aspx?chapter=N (weekly)
  -> the (section, bid) versions in force;
  :GET OneSection.aspx?section=S&bid=B
  (re-read every 180 days; a new version is a new bid);
  :content block verbatim + text, effective line,
  footnotes (session-law history first);
  :mo_revisor_sections;
end fork
:mo_revisor_chapters;
:dbt: stg_mo_revisor__chapters / __sections / __repeals
-> int_mo_revisor__session_law_bills (history notes -> bills)
-> fct_statute_sections, fct_bill_statute_links;
stop
@enduml
